{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valdis blends tower defense strategy with dynamic third-person shooter action and survival elements.</strong> Defend your base against increasingly dangerous mutant zombie hordes \u2014 from slow walkers to kamikaze units and invisible enemies. Every level tests your tactics, reflexes, and battlefield control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic incident aboard the space station Valdis infected the entire crew with a deadly zombie virus. You are the last survivor in this sci-fi nightmare. Armed with automated defense turrets and a powerful shotgun, protect the station\u2019s energy core in intense wave-based survival combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/b90e260b1514b3eceafdd4650e2c3fec.poster.avif?t=1772059296\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/b90e260b1514b3eceafdd4650e2c3fec.webm?t=1772059296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/b90e260b1514b3eceafdd4650e2c3fec.mp4?t=1772059296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various turret types \u2014 blasters, lasers, mortars, automated cannons, and more. Combine them to create an effective base defense strategy. Smart placement, resource management, and adaptation are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turret belongs to one of three elements \u2014 Fire, Ice, or Water. The elemental combat system applies status effects: slow enemies, ignite them, or control crowds. Combine elements to trigger powerful elemental reactions and destructive synergies. Experiment with builds and discover your ideal defense strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/7c4642b31b1c977c4a094a1e279e1cd4.poster.avif?t=1772059296\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/7c4642b31b1c977c4a094a1e279e1cd4.webm?t=1772059296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/7c4642b31b1c977c4a094a1e279e1cd4.mp4?t=1772059296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Valdis offers a first look at the station defense system:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 3 turret types<br>\u2013 3 elements<br>\u2013 3 enemy types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will expand the arsenal with new turrets, elements, enemies, harder waves, and deeper strategic variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002220/extras/e5756ff0973866e56f78871f6daeb50e.poster.avif?t=1772059296\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta